      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GLORIA KEEPING (8) pinged the lids and led throughout to score last start (35.56) at this track in Grade 4/5 over 622m. Yet to miss the placings from three starts out of this box. Expected to be right there at the finish again. ZIPPING EVANIA (2) has a strong record here with 10 wins and seven placings from 24 starts. Below best last time at this track (36.24) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 9 length fourth. Looks a key chance on best figures. FALSE WITNESS (1) comes off an average performance last start when eighth at this track over 622m behind ZIPPING EVANIA (36.56) in a Grade 5. Placed at his previous run. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Likely to be thereabouts. WEST ROCK CASEY (5) is a last start winner and can go on with it.",
